IMG_2[and this its icon]: images/help-art01/OreMine-icon.png

SUBH: Formulas

1: 209 labor + 1 ore reserve =&gt; 5000 ore

2: 209 labor + 5000 ore =&gt; 1 ore reserve

Ore mines target 80% ore inventory. If producing 5000 ore would not exceed 80% inventory, then formula 1 is applied. If consuming 5000 ore would not make the remaining inventory less than 80%, then formula 2 is applied.

